WEBVTT

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.241
If the divine, cockeyed genius
assigned to your case

00:18:30.265 --> 00:18:35.325
decides to let some sort of wonderment
be glimpsed, for just one moment

00:18:35.349 --> 00:18:38.029
through your efforts, then "Olé!"

00:18:38.053 --> 00:18:40.964
And if not, do your dance anyhow.

00:18:40.988 --> 00:18:42.645
And "Olé!" to you, nonetheless.

00:18:42.669 --> 00:18:44.955
I believe this and I feel
that we must teach it.

00:18:44.979 --> 00:18:46.433
"Olé!" to you, nonetheless,

00:18:46.457 --> 00:18:49.746
just for having the sheer
human love and stubbornness

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.591
to keep showing up.

00:18:51.615 --> 00:18:53.266
Thank you.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.341
(Applause)

00:18:55.365 --> 00:18:56.832
Thank you.

00:18:56.856 --> 00:18:59.946
(Applause)

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.779
June Cohen: Olé!